---
import Simple from "../../views/Simple.astro";
import { site } from "../../site";
---
<Simple lang="en" title="Privacy policy" description="How The Meowpany handles your personal data under Uruguayan Law 18,331.">
  <p>The Meowpany ("we") is responsible for the personal data you send through this site. We handle it under Uruguay's Personal Data Protection Law 18,331.</p>
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>Only what you type into the forms: name, company, email, phone, your project description and, in the audit, the address of the site to check. We use no tracking or advertising cookies.</p>
  <h2>Why</h2>
  <p>To reply to you, prepare a proposal and, if you hire us, deliver the service. We never sell or share your data.</p>
  <h2>Services involved</h2>
  <p>This site is static and has no server of its own. For the forms to work, your browser sends the data directly to these services, which process it on our behalf: Web3Forms, which forwards what you write to our inbox; Google PageSpeed Insights, which receives the address of the site to audit; and, if you use the booking link, Cal.com. If none is available, the form opens your own email app with the message written out and you decide whether to send it. The site is hosted on GitHub Pages, which logs technical data about visits, such as IP addresses, for security.</p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>You can ask to access, correct or delete your data at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
</Simple>
